WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.739
The checkpoint tests the boundaries that matter in real work.

2
00:00:03.739 --> 00:00:06.927
Identify RISC-V International as the standards body.

3
00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:11.034
Recognise OpenHW Foundation as an Eclipse Foundation Working Group.

4
00:00:11.034 --> 00:00:15.753
Preserve the boundary between working-group influence and project governance.

5
00:00:15.753 --> 00:00:27.400
Finally, identify processor RTL, verification, documentation, software, integration assets, and releases as possible OpenHW outputs, while leaving ISA ratification with RISC-V International.

